WEBVTT

00:02:58.575 --> 00:03:01.890
"I am totally, completely competent,"

00:03:01.914 --> 00:03:05.995
is damning yourself
with the faintest of praise.

00:03:06.424 --> 00:03:08.392
And then, of course, another excuse:

00:03:08.416 --> 00:03:11.972
"Well, I would do this,
I would do this, but, but --

00:03:11.996 --> 00:03:15.503
well, after all, I'm not weird.

00:03:15.963 --> 00:03:18.653
Everybody knows that people
who pursue their passions

00:03:18.677 --> 00:03:20.080
are somewhat obsessive.

00:03:20.104 --> 00:03:21.573
A little strange.

00:03:21.597 --> 00:03:23.232
Hmm? Hmm? Okay?

00:03:23.256 --> 00:03:26.478
You know, a fine line
between madness and genius.

00:03:26.502 --> 00:03:30.787
"I'm not weird. I've read
Steven J.'s biography.